# Job title keywords for selective salary & remote work enrichment.
# Comma-separated list of phrases. Any job whose title contains one of these
# phrases (case-insensitive) will have its detail page fetched to extract
# salary information and work-mode classification (remote / hybrid / onsite).
#
# Leave unset or empty to enrich ALL jobs (backward-compatible).
#
# Example:
# JOB_TITLE_CONTAINS="product manager, program manager, engineering manager"
JOB_TITLE_CONTAINS=
